Now it is time to go home.
I go to the reception desk.
I have the rented racket in my hand.
I give it to the staff member.
The staff member smiles.
He asks, "Madam, was the game good?"
I say, "Yes, it was very good."
"Next Thursday I will come again."
"I like the club very much."
"So now I go here to play every Thursday."
The staff member says, "Very good."
"You can come next week too."
I say thank you to him.
I go outside the club building.
I head towards home.
I like this new Thursday routine.
Now I have new friends.
Amit, Neha, and Sanjay are my friends.
I am very happy.
